    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21cd47155fd01180",
      "translationZh": "我是 Failure Map 的创建者，这是一个收录精简 Python 调试任务的档案库。公开发布版包含 254 个类别的 20,168 项任务，提供标准库实现、明确的契约、失败的修复尝试，以及可执行的边界检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21ffecfb0ffeb9cd",
      "translationZh": "可以试试这三个小案例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "543c206227289021",
      "translationZh": "• 重复投递：对相同金额去重会丢失合法事件。https://failuremap.org/cases/FA-001",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67cf926f7f3ec878",
      "translationZh": "• 缓存过期：减去一个完整的时钟单位会拒绝仍然有效的条目。https://failuremap.org/cases/FA-006",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a839ad972dee265a",
      "translationZh": "• 分页：将 > 改为 >= 会重复返回游标记录。https://failuremap.org/cases/FA-011",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45e3c994eda6a738",
      "translationZh": "提示词模板：“修复 solve 函数，使其满足所述契约。仅返回 Python 源代码。保留函数签名。契约：prompt。存在缺陷的实现：broken_source。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2262db9053fb8cb1",
      "translationZh": "实测程序基线，每组 3 项检查中的通过数（有缺陷的实现 / 修复尝试）：FA-001 2/3 / 1/3；FA-006 2/3 / 2/3；FA-011 2/3 / 1/3。这些是所附程序的执行结果，不是模型得分。我目前还没有可报告的本地模型实测结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d0b8ac9690f3392",
      "translationZh": "要比较不同运行，请报告确切的模型及修订版本、量化方式、提示词、采样设置、随机种子、每项任务的尝试次数，以及通过数量。在隔离环境中运行候选代码，并将评分用的测试夹具置于其控制范围之外。通过已记录的检查，并不代表在隐藏测试中的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fe944879274d8a6",
      "translationZh": "下载：https://failuremap.org/api/exports/tasks.jsonl.gz",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcf6abf917b57c7c",
      "translationZh": "方法论：https://failuremap.org/methodology",
